WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.088 --> 00:00:21.351
the humans finally had lunch, everyone headed outside to the soccer field.

2
00:00:22.571 --> 00:00:26.534
"We have a friendly game of soccer planned," explained Mr.

3
00:00:26.574 --> 00:00:30.156
Freaky. Ben saw Mayor Hubbletree's face brighten.

4
00:00:31.656 --> 00:00:33.738
"I didn't know monsters like soccer.

5
00:00:34.799 --> 00:00:38.842
I played soccer in college—I was actually rather good at the game."

6
00:00:40.263 --> 00:00:41.564
Mr. Freaky beamed.

7
00:00:41.584 --> 00:00:45.166
"Wonderful! It's going to be very exciting!"

8
00:00:46.607 --> 00:00:48.829
Ben sat near his friends in the bleachers.

9
00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:54.273
He watched the Monster Academy soccer team walk onto the grass.

10
00:00:56.535 --> 00:00:58.016
The human team followed them.

11
00:01:01.372 --> 00:01:03.053
Mr. Gwarg was already there.

12
00:01:05.153 --> 00:01:06.994
A large bag sat beside him.

13
00:01:07.014 --> 00:01:11.055
"Listen up, monsters," said the gym teacher.

14
00:01:11.075 --> 00:01:16.716
"You're playing against humans today, so there are a few rule changes."

15
00:01:17.797 --> 00:01:19.577
A tiny goblin raised his hand.

16
00:01:19.597 --> 00:01:23.378
"We can still throw fireballs at each other, right?"

17
00:01:24.878 --> 00:01:26.259
A human player gulped.

18
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:31.432
not," said Mr.

19
00:01:31.492 --> 00:01:35.615
Gwarg. "The humans can't do that, so it wouldn't be fair.

20
00:01:36.555 --> 00:01:41.078
You also can't use claws, fangs, or any kind of magic."

21
00:01:41.978 --> 00:01:46.721
Zork huffed, "This game is going to be so boring."

22
00:01:46.741 --> 00:01:52.004
"It'll be just like regular soccer," said Mr.

23
00:01:52.064 --> 00:01:55.066
Gwarg. "But safer for the humans.

24
00:01:55.866 --> 00:01:57.867
Oh, and there's no flying."

25
00:01:57.887 --> 00:02:01.209
"What!" cried a monster with wings.

26
00:02:01.229 --> 00:02:03.930
"How can we play without flying?"

27
00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:06.651
Mr. Gwarg folded his arms.

28
00:02:06.671 --> 00:02:11.453
"If the humans can play without flying, then so can you, Leo."

29
00:02:13.514 --> 00:02:18.196
"That's not a problem for me," said a worm monster.

30
00:02:18.216 --> 00:02:20.537
"I can't fly anyway."

31
00:02:21.997 --> 00:02:25.919
"You can't pop up from underground either, Francis," Mr.

32
00:02:25.959 --> 00:02:26.739
Gwarg said.

33
00:02:26.759 --> 00:02:30.181
"Boo," said the worm.

34
00:02:32.682 --> 00:02:35.104
Soon the players took their positions on the field.

35
00:02:36.585 --> 00:02:39.567
The monsters' goalie was an enormous green blob.

36
00:02:39.587 --> 00:02:42.429
"Hey, no fair!"

37
00:02:42.789 --> 00:02:43.970
shouted a human boy.

38
00:02:43.990 --> 00:02:46.712
"Your goalie fills the entire goal!"

39
00:02:46.732 --> 00:02:49.554
"Yeah," said a girl.

40
00:02:49.574 --> 00:02:52.736
"We should have two goalies to make it even!"

41
00:02:52.756 --> 00:02:56.138
"What!" said a fish monster.

42
00:02:56.158 --> 00:02:58.900
"Two of our players are zombies.

43
00:03:00.112 --> 00:03:03.494
You humans should lose two players if we're going to keep things even!"

44
00:03:03.514 --> 00:03:05.215
"No way!"

45
00:03:05.815 --> 00:03:06.655
said another girl.

46
00:03:06.675 --> 00:03:09.437
"You guys have a two-headed monster!

47
00:03:10.077 --> 00:03:11.878
She should count as two players!"

48
00:03:13.078 --> 00:03:14.799
Mr. Gwarg blew his whistle.

49
00:03:14.819 --> 00:03:18.401
"Let's start the game!"

50
00:03:19.962 --> 00:03:24.644
The gym teacher carried the bag to the center of the field and pulled out the game ball.

51
00:03:26.064 --> 00:03:30.928
Wiggling tentacles covered it, and electrical sparks danced across its surface.

52
00:03:32.269 --> 00:03:35.252
The human players shrieked and ran off the field.

53
00:03:42.738 --> 00:03:43.519
is that thing?"

54
00:03:43.919 --> 00:03:45.080
cried Mayor Hubbletree.

55
00:03:46.321 --> 00:03:48.403
Mr. Freaky blinked in surprise.

56
00:03:48.423 --> 00:03:51.426
"It's a soccer ball, Mayor.

57
00:03:52.346 --> 00:03:53.928
I thought you said you used to play?"

58
00:03:55.064 --> 00:03:56.825
"That's not a soccer ball, Freaky!"

59
00:03:57.186 --> 00:03:58.166
the mayor shouted.

60
00:03:58.186 --> 00:04:01.689
"That's a disgusting—Oh, never mind.

61
00:04:02.029 --> 00:04:03.830
This whole trip is a disaster."

62
00:04:04.631 --> 00:04:09.214
A moment later a human player ran back from the bus with a new soccer ball.

63
00:04:09.974 --> 00:04:13.757
Ben saw that this one had no tentacles or electrical sparks.

64
00:04:13.777 --> 00:04:16.739
"We're using our ball for the game!"

65
00:04:17.239 --> 00:04:18.540
Mayor Hubbletree snapped.

66
00:04:20.041 --> 00:04:23.183
A few monster players started to argue, but Mr.

67
00:04:23.243 --> 00:04:24.464
Gwarg shot them a look.

68
00:04:28.516 --> 00:04:31.157
"Fine," the gym teacher told the mayor.

69
00:04:34.118 --> 00:04:36.518
A tall boy quickly got control of the ball.

70
00:04:39.799 --> 00:04:41.720
He passed it to a girl up the field.

71
00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:45.361
"That's Rebecca," said Dave.

72
00:04:45.381 --> 00:04:47.601
"She's really good at soccer."

73
00:04:49.262 --> 00:04:51.082
Rebecca dribbled the ball fast.

74
00:04:52.422 --> 00:04:57.804
Leo ran in front of her, but Rebecca got the ball past him and continued down the field.

75
00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:01.862
She rushed past the two zombie defenders and took a shot.

76
00:05:03.363 --> 00:05:06.706
The goalie blob lunged toward the ball, but he was too slow.

77
00:05:08.627 --> 00:05:11.249
The ball went past him, and the humans cheered.

78
00:05:11.269 --> 00:05:16.352
"Score one for the humans!"

79
00:05:16.953 --> 00:05:17.573
shouted Mr.

80
00:05:17.613 --> 00:05:20.615
Gwarg. The monsters had the ball now.

81
00:05:21.316 --> 00:05:24.818
The tiny goblin ran toward three large human players.

82
00:05:25.699 --> 00:05:30.153
Keeping perfect control of the ball, the goblin scooted between a player's feet.

83
00:05:30.173 --> 00:05:32.754
"Hey!" the kid yelled.

84
00:05:33.794 --> 00:05:36.195
The goblin reached the humans' goal and shot.

85
00:05:37.275 --> 00:05:40.736
The goalie caught the ball and threw it toward a player nearby.

86
00:05:41.836 --> 00:05:43.897
The boy dribbled the ball past Leo.

87
00:05:45.417 --> 00:05:48.478
The monster flapped his wings and flew after the boy.

88
00:05:49.739 --> 00:05:51.499
Mr. Gwarg blew his whistle.

89
00:05:51.519 --> 00:05:53.880
"No flying!"

90
00:05:55.452 --> 00:05:58.774
"Sorry!" said Leo, dropping back to the ground.

91
00:06:00.075 --> 00:06:03.658
The goblin took the ball from the boy and headed back up the field.

92
00:06:04.338 --> 00:06:09.041
A moment later a big human kid charged toward the goblin, knocking him over.

93
00:06:09.061 --> 00:06:12.804
"Ow!" cried the goblin.

94
00:06:12.824 --> 00:06:14.505
"No fair!"

95
00:06:14.525 --> 00:06:16.366
"Sure, it's fair!"

96
00:06:16.967 --> 00:06:18.608
the kid called over his shoulder.

97
00:06:18.628 --> 00:06:21.229
"You can check in— Oof!"

98
00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:24.852
Francis had popped out of the ground, tripping the kid.

99
00:06:25.672 --> 00:06:27.693
Mr. Gwarg blew his whistle again.

100
00:06:27.713 --> 00:06:31.736
"Francis!" "Sorry!"

101
00:06:32.176 --> 00:06:32.997
called the worm.

102
00:06:33.937 --> 00:06:35.378
Now Rebecca had the ball.

103
00:06:36.098 --> 00:06:38.440
She headed down the field and took another shot.

104
00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:41.201
The ball knocked over a zombie.

105
00:06:42.442 --> 00:06:44.684
In the bleachers Waldo shook his head.

106
00:06:44.704 --> 00:06:48.606
"How did those zombies ever get on the team?"

107
00:06:49.366 --> 00:06:50.207
Ben shrugged.

108
00:06:50.227 --> 00:06:51.668
"Don't ask me."

109
00:06:52.704 --> 00:06:55.848
The ball was still sitting in the grass near the fallen zombie.

110
00:06:56.689 --> 00:07:01.816
As Rebecca ran to it, light flashed—and the ball turned into a gigantic spider!
